note('Weight diagnostics: in mid windows the signed SwiGLU trace agrees on PC1 and mildly PC2 (PC2 at L12 has a stronger safe lexical contrast, +.14 vs +.09; negative mean gate, up, and down effects all agree on its sign). Late windows L18–24 instead show opposite signs between the principal down/o axis signed by safe lexical contrast and the gate/up/attention-bias contractions; do not trust a late lexical-only sign. O/V gradient-identity attempt has only ~0.0–0.05 random-sketch Frobenius correlations; weak evidence compared to middle.')